# Code owners for Outis.
#
# Owners listed here are automatically requested for review on any pull request
# touching a matching path.
#
# NOTE: this file only *requests* review. It is not enforced until branch
# protection on `main` enables "Require review from Code Owners".
#
# Syntax:  <path pattern>  <owner…>
# Later matching rules win, so order matters — put the broadest rule first.
#
# An owner must have write access to the repository, otherwise GitHub reports
# "Unknown owner" and the rule is silently skipped.

